<title>AUSTRIA: Janus Capital owns up to 10% of Wolford.</title>
<headline>Janus Capital owns up to 10% of Wolford.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denver-based Janus Capital Corp owns between five and 10 percent of Austria's luxury hosiery and lingerie maker Wolford AG, Wolford said in an announcement published in daily Wiener Zeitung on Wednesday. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12 254</p>
</text>
